---
# Static analysis for the project's own sources (`just analyze`). Warnings are errors.
Checks: >
  -*,
  bugprone-*,
  cert-*,
  clang-analyzer-*,
  concurrency-*,
  cppcoreguidelines-*,
  misc-*,
  modernize-*,
  performance-*,
  portability-*,
  readability-*,
  -cppcoreguidelines-avoid-magic-numbers,
  -readability-magic-numbers,
  -modernize-use-trailing-return-type,
  -readability-identifier-length,
  -misc-include-cleaner,
  -portability-avoid-pragma-once
WarningsAsErrors: "*"
HeaderFilterRegex: "(src|include)/"
FormatStyle: file
...
